    <body>
      <div type="clause" n="20.4">
        <head><ref type="lawCode" target="law:IIAs">II As</ref> 20.4</head>
        <ab type="selectedText" xml:lang="und">⁊ se þe be [ðissum] geswican nylle, ðonne ridon þa yldestan men to, ealle þe to þære byrig hyron, ⁊ nimon eall ðæt he age—⁊ fó se cyng to healfum, to healfum ða men ðe on þære rade beon—⁊ setton hine on borh.</ab>
        <ab type="translation" xml:lang="en">Again, if any even then will not desist, all the chief men who belong to the borough shall ride and take all he possesses, and the king shall receive half, and the men who ride to apprehend him the other half, and they shall place him under surety.</ab>
        <ab type="supplementaryText" xml:lang="und">⁊ se þe be ðissum geswican nylle, ðonne riden ða yldestan men, ealle þe to ðære byrig hyren, ⁊ nimen ealle þæt he age—⁊ fó se cyng to healfum, to healfum ða men þe on þære rád syn—⁊ setten hine on borh.</ab>
      </div>
    </body>
